# Samplesift

Samplesift is a Python package for building reusable data projections and their
integrations.

## Installation

Install the framework-independent package:

```shell
pip install samplesift
```

Install Django support when it is needed:

```shell
pip install "samplesift[django]"
```

Then add the Django app to `INSTALLED_APPS`:

```python
INSTALLED_APPS = [
    # ...
    "samplesift.django.apps.SamplesiftDjangoConfig",
]
```

## Repository layout

```text
src/samplesift/       Python package and optional integrations
tests/                Python test suite
docs/                 Architecture and design documentation
frontend/             Reserved, self-contained frontend workspace
```

The Python package and future npm packages are deliberately independent. The
frontend will eventually have its own `frontend/package.json` and publishable
packages under `frontend/packages/`; it must not introduce a root npm workspace
or couple npm releases to the Python distribution.

Future Python integrations are exposed as extras when implemented, for example
`samplesift[jupyter]` and `samplesift[sandbox]`.
